Description: programming language with romanized Nepali keywords
 NepLang is a small programming language for Nepali developers. It mixes
 romanized Nepali control-flow words (vana, yedi, natara, jabasamma,
 ko_lagi, kaam, farkau) with English technical terms, and gives
 beginner-friendly error messages that point at the exact line and column.
